1. Document Purpose

This document converts the approved Stage 1 concept and Stage 2 charter into a technical plan for the TENTORA MVP.

It defines:

The system architecture.

Backend and frontend module boundaries.

Core user and data flows.

The relational database model.

The Ready Design editor model.

Taste Profile and Creative DNA structures.

Matching and team-recommendation logic.

AI responsibilities and safety boundaries.

REST API resources.

Authentication, storage, security, testing, and deployment strategies.

The document replaces the earlier interior-design execution-provider architecture. TENTORA no longer operates as a homeowner, designer, provider, plan, and offer marketplace. Its current model is based on sectors, services, ready designs, visual taste, creatives, recommendations, and creative project workspaces.

