13.3 Provider Interface

All model calls should use an internal interface such as:

AIProvider.execute(action_type, input_payload, policy_context) -> structured_result

The application must not depend directly on one provider's response format.

13.4 Guardrails

Check the Ready Design ai_policy before every action.

Send only the minimum required content to a model provider.

Validate model output against a strict schema.

Do not overwrite user content without preview and confirmation.

Do not use portfolio or Ready Design assets for training without explicit permission.

Log provider, model version, action type, input references, result status, and user acceptance.

Provide deterministic fallback when an AI action fails.

